# Measurement scaffolding for the engraver — a second Vite entry point that
# renders NotationView at the printed worship aid's real dimensions so the
# staff size, lyric size and syllable gaps can be measured off the rendered
# SVG. Diagnostic only; nothing in src/ imports it and the build never sees
# it (Vite's only entry is index.html). Deliberately not shipped.
harness/
